#: scenario3:scenario3_52D2A2A6_5BE3_4196_8586_D6BF70936841
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: da932d21288960011b712fbcfae85c15bc6dbbf1fa6a44d4479ed05145a76b92
#. default-sha256: 6661c80ab3d62897cfaf069618e7e3dd643ba88d9e2e4192617ce2c351b05bc2
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_52D2A2A6_5BE3_4196_8586_D6BF70936841"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫The next morning, Jacopo stood alone in the den by the billiards "
"table."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Il mattino seguente, Jacopo si trovava da solo nel proprio covo,"
"⟪k:6⟫di fianco al tavolo da biliardo."

#: scenario3:scenario3_A0F51FDE_0032_46B7_9E37_076DBD34C565
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cca22471074751e4c07f79132a496e5930b5b7c253945dbc073ff9e5bb236f31
#. default-sha256: 8fa74a35ada6bceae13bf63413dc4fc43bb070ce08e11f82096b70c2817edf13
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A0F51FDE_0032_46B7_9E37_076DBD34C565"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He appeared to be rather agitated."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Sembrava piuttosto agitato."

#: scenario3:scenario3_716AE35B_1F15_4014_A7EF_681027C6BBDE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 43af8a10c70630b746fe38298565a3ce72c48ff3f9fb6a53b71d2ebacdc3a77f
#. default-sha256: c9d4876f53d59eb3ae488d66d38bdfddbe10f6ef78ada149e471981e69f4533c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_716AE35B_1F15_4014_A7EF_681027C6BBDE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫His face was twisted into a frown, his pointer finger tapping restlessly against the hard "
"surface of the table."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Con lo sguardo minaccioso, e l’indice che picchiettava irrequieto sulla superficie del "
"tavolo."

#: scenario3:scenario3_61C40033_1D40_401E_B3A5_DE79C4FF4BE6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8b6b2f2973d771251b9585f4c685e78ae52b57e4af8297c3606fbda774e278c6
#. default-sha256: 0fd9e7853ea58e007e475bc51e5d2cd89d49a720a421b28db31a975c009eabf3
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_61C40033_1D40_401E_B3A5_DE79C4FF4BE6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Evidently no longer able to stay in one place,⟪k:1⟫he paced a circle around the table,⟪k:2⟫"
"then swiped up a rack and a cue,⟪k:3⟫setting up a game of nine-ball."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non riuscendo più a stare fermo, fece un giro attorno al tavolo,⟪k:1⟫poi prese un triangolo "
"e una stecca, preparando una partita a nove palle."

#: scenario3:scenario3_235FD550_CC68_4883_9BEB_73160CDB082A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 784ee8ceec80170f8d510968d22ff3d4a6d589605367dc6b6848d97f78c0fcd8
#. default-sha256: 8874dc8b35b41fca9c9ad629c34772c649c6c606ea5e46670af41121d1d9f93c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_235FD550_CC68_4883_9BEB_73160CDB082A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I am not intimately familiar with the ways by which men entertain themselves, but in truth, "
"I was bewitched by the sight of him leaning over the table."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non conosco i modi in cui gli uomini si divertono, ma a dir la verità,⟪k:1⟫ero stregata "
"dalla vista dell’uomo chino sul tavolo,"

#: scenario3:scenario3_C3DC4ABC_3CD9_4511_A4B2_7771DA2C2B1E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e68d8beed38bfe5237ad0a5953a954fbcb11883b1da66cf232a27d7ef500cd8d
#. default-sha256: 9e69ddb5d5b967d702863a515ec39b8c0a3c9d67682c6f33a8e94ea6dff0feeb
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C3DC4ABC_3CD9_4511_A4B2_7771DA2C2B1E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It almost seemed as though a steel rod ran straight from his shoulder to the tip of his "
"outstretched finger, upon which the cue was secured by another finger looped over it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫con l’asta di legno che partiva dalla sua spalla giungendo sino alla punta del suo dito "
"disteso, e tenuta ferma da un altro dito."

#: scenario3:scenario3_77C3C8BB_D837_4967_9254_8B45736A2CBB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 92b6f6eb82896c0e7dd973892753fa6cc9c787d832bdce785d1a8d0a5105bf7a
#. default-sha256: dc9536b7f0301259d275357affab7481bbd8f1c46510b34a39bb3427a7b8ad26
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_77C3C8BB_D837_4967_9254_8B45736A2CBB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫With a smooth, flowing motion, he thrust the cue forward slightly, pulling it back and "
"repeating the process once more..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Con un movimento morbido e fluido, protese leggermente la stecca in avanti, tirandola poi "
"indietro e ripetendo il processo ancora una volta..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_243CAC15_920E_473F_986D_47BC5C4EFD19
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ec8575463ba9e97cc86afe4991bb4e67566e07929e310bbc3f8e8688b841414a
#. default-sha256: 6ebdad52a41a23104be4735b9bf741bfe616ed4622eee73f7eb7cc078298db31
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_243CAC15_920E_473F_986D_47BC5C4EFD19"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫before ramming it into the cue ball, sending it rolling into the diamond of colored "
"balls. ⟪k:2⟫A chorus of ⟪k:3⟫click⟪k:4⟫s and ⟪k:5⟫clack⟪k:6⟫s emanated from the center of the "
"room."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫prima di colpire con forza il pallino, facendolo rotolare verso il diamante di palle "
"colorate.⟪k:2⟫ Un coro di ⟪k:3⟫click⟪k:4⟫ e ⟪k:5⟫clack⟪k:6⟫ risuonò al centro della stanza."

#: scenario3:scenario3_32B08C6F_C677_4FC8_A80F_B6F661D3B11D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 26b640a1838705b37d6628080e50b52ab860d607c8031da61361cc1dc006b5b8
#. default-sha256: f6fe543f0cbb192dd7624bdb09e64d12bc1cb1c186ddc639cd2f55e9056b408c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_32B08C6F_C677_4FC8_A80F_B6F661D3B11D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Balls collided with one another and ricocheted off the cushioned walls, a few landing in the "
"pockets situated around the edge of the table."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Le palline si scontrarono l’una contro l’altra, rimbalzando sulle pareti imbottite; alcune "
"finirono nelle buche situate ai bordi del tavolo."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9AD8D874_3530_497C_8B36_E1E928C2B206
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 889c482b9264600865a2ed2207c294f93ef5e187a90131bd15431f8d2abaadd4
#. default-sha256: 247430aea3ae0907bbfe2ea8e9e7a75f2dab27ade27015d6d8ffe9c9364357c4
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9AD8D874_3530_497C_8B36_E1E928C2B206"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Jacopo appeared to have accomplished this with little trouble, but I imagine merely striking "
"the cue ball with the stick would be rather difficult for someone inexperienced."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Jacopo sembrava esserci riuscito senza tanti sforzi, ma dubito che colpire semplicemente il "
"pallino con la stecca sarebbe stato altrettanto facile per un giocatore inesperto."

#: scenario3:scenario3_87B9FABD_0AF8_4D8E_888C_A3CF4F854016
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 34f23a0e648e27abdf303e08c3458dfa2ad7f20a58c01607ae03c8181497b548
#. default-sha256: 649a2fbdc57ce6bba861352b077fe94c7b7d9b79fb9e322df30125777179de4a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_87B9FABD_0AF8_4D8E_888C_A3CF4F854016"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But despite his accomplishment, it seemed to only exacerbate his agitation."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ma nonostante il suo risultato, sembrava ancora più agitato."

#: scenario3:scenario3_959AC811_76E7_4738_9FCA_55B66A009317
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b9d14c42f0ce5c360b9feb523a18cbf8d7ec831d5aaa25aac761c64cd61e1625
#. default-sha256: 5f29422f251d3b89638c9e74a96f8c0fa1be639e77a700a1baf511219a89c036
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_959AC811_76E7_4738_9FCA_55B66A009317"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Lousy positioning,” he muttered, though I hadn’t the faintest idea what he was talking "
"about."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Pessimo posizionamento”, mormorò, anche se non avevo la benché minima idea di cosa stesse "
"parlando."

#: scenario3:scenario3_E270133C_E277_4CB8_B4E3_B71C691D10D4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f9dccbbdb099687e008e823e5e3705210564c02d8c4874028717a95077d48534
#. default-sha256: b450a5ecbc5962fb2472896266984622b79de3d9adfa8991bd60df2bf849ccaf
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_E270133C_E277_4CB8_B4E3_B71C691D10D4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫What should have been a game for his enjoyment, he went about with a constant look of "
"exasperation."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Quella che doveva essere una partita iniziata per svago, lo condusse in uno stato di "
"costante esasperazione."

#: scenario3:scenario3_2FC95DA7_3AE1_4C19_AFD3_4BB7B16D0B44
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d5602665b60b0893b90bb487b1962ca05e1416f97d5e56993342032e7792737a
#. default-sha256: 5cdf4b47971b506d2a554ccbe7871f12324544ba93ddbee4f08aec5551cc70f5
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_2FC95DA7_3AE1_4C19_AFD3_4BB7B16D0B44"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I suspect he was using it as a way to blow off steam."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Suppongo che lo stesse facendo per sfogarsi."

#: scenario3:scenario3_51C47889_DC66_4189_9F8F_3FED3A536542
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 311df9aaf9ae8bfdc0c287969dac10b3f0b462b0e70635af92bb0f315391df89
#. default-sha256: 44ebd365553cc2ae0a9629aee37a6b47150d9bf80f1fd913f68f92812f1be03c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_51C47889_DC66_4189_9F8F_3FED3A536542"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And as a result, the tension in the air was palpable."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫E come risultato, la tensione nell’aria divenne palpabile."

#: scenario3:scenario3_A510D6AC_7F9B_44BF_85F1_D2C660EFBDFD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0661a625dd935e7825738dd7f3dea21425903f0118138779f11641c5423c0241
#. default-sha256: 3fe98313f0c4c5735eff2ecd49790c66c81de513978ae7da565564cf18fa9780
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A510D6AC_7F9B_44BF_85F1_D2C660EFBDFD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I felt it would be improper to intrude upon him, even considering my distaste for the man."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Sentivo che sarebbe stato inopportuno invadere il suo spazio,⟪k:1⟫pur considerando la mia "
"avversione per l’uomo."

#: scenario3:scenario3_D8E0D881_70AE_48C2_9AD8_14F49E160D98
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bb36d48456e3c748d8e92fe2f4f52cf09e328b8c07f17ee9b3bebed49f81d757
#. default-sha256: 24c8a4a8577141e4d2ec1907ba7347133b048c30948836492be2cb360f87224f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D8E0D881_70AE_48C2_9AD8_14F49E160D98"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫There was an undeniable beauty in every motion he made, every perfectly audible ⟪k:1⟫"
"clack⟪k:2⟫ of billiards balls bouncing off one another."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫C’era una bellezza innegabile in ogni suo movimento, e nei risonanti ⟪k:1⟫clack⟪k:2⟫ delle "
"palle che si colpivano a vicenda."

#: scenario3:scenario3_798A17A7_980A_4A56_8ACE_528CA242B704
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eba1296a0ab66e40ceff55a96208b347ce28e8b47525c99b8281df9368b77b3a
#. default-sha256: 84e747db646eab09e9303ec69b5e31382da506e3ea2b41af12a4ba614d490a38
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_798A17A7_980A_4A56_8ACE_528CA242B704"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It was... ⟪k:1⟫an enchanting sight."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Era... ⟪k:1⟫uno spettacolo ammaliante."

#: scenario3:scenario3_D07E8173_C9AE_4047_83B1_A758FAD2AA4A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f7d06cb556aeb54bcd747bb2aff116aab73600294700647256af5cba86f364ef
#. default-sha256: bbb0d755ac279745be3612bc5640d8ef07be08af4c77b83b011d1cd2f61be933
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D07E8173_C9AE_4047_83B1_A758FAD2AA4A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But then, someone without the slightest regard or appreciation for beauty came marching in "
"with a hammer to shatter it like glass."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ma poi, qualcuno senza il minimo riguardo o apprezzamento per la bellezza, si presentò, "
"intenzionato a distruggere quell’armonia."

#: scenario3:scenario3_7B37DB59_2906_47C3_8DB4_20B56BD5A096
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4c269982c3425a949baa9391699f3f100e42b319a2a3f91ba1b1f326f3c5bdce
#. default-sha256: d5bdb7a76d612a5a5b5f4150583d4b559480f65b70d9bf9e8aab116fb90a8a93
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7B37DB59_2906_47C3_8DB4_20B56BD5A096"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Gotta say, that was pretty impressive."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Devo ammetterlo, è stato davvero impressionante."

#: scenario3:scenario3_4312ACA6_E508_41CD_9B1C_5A5C8C3D221A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 471b860f74dac0b88dd92d066df272fe2f701d750584d7de374afe096ce3c9bf
#. default-sha256: d5413f510812c33b161c877dd39ab1f60a3a60730b00e17afea4ba1438db3df9
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_4312ACA6_E508_41CD_9B1C_5A5C8C3D221A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫...!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫...!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_53A099CE_6249_4467_BC84_4B848C0DE1D0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6156c2521706e022202db626e79e24f9eb6bef80798da99850ce5690c874e52a
#. default-sha256: 99bb47d90cb5ee8b9f454655664eb0acf9ba36debe67020635904c4b8d3881d2
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_53A099CE_6249_4467_BC84_4B848C0DE1D0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫A man leaned against the frame of the open door—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫he was neither a resident nor "
"worker of the mansion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Un uomo era appoggiato allo stipite della porta aperta—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫non era né un residente né "
"un dipendente della villa."

#: scenario3:scenario3_DEA168F3_64C0_4E53_BEE0_05349674E065
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0fc093e33bfd41dd08e836af43cda9faa22830837963515e6b1d0b28ea5d4e96
#. default-sha256: 0d4948fbc56d59270554f3e12c71581e90a66f3adc40188c0c954e0e5f9668f3
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DEA168F3_64C0_4E53_BEE0_05349674E065"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The man’s face was covered in scraggly stubble, his body draped in grime-caked garments. "
"⟪k:1⟫His eyes were sunken so deep it was as though I was looking at a fleshless skull—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫"
"though there was a feral glimmer in them."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Aveva il volto coperto da una barbetta incolta, e indossava indumenti incrostati di "
"sporcizia. ⟪k:1⟫I suoi occhi erano incavati così in profondità che pareva come guardare un "
"teschio senza carne—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫sebbene avessero un che di selvaggio."

#: scenario3:scenario3_F746C573_71F2_40C1_9A53_877C72A2260E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 100d4daa3ece4bb62188a7c61375d642d223858fbd03425350dabf88e46a5d05
#. default-sha256: cf02889adffdd2c723c432509d1944b0e54dae44468962708d80ddbede672789
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F746C573_71F2_40C1_9A53_877C72A2260E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Needless to say, he was not prim and proper."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Inutile sottolineare che non sembrava essere un uomo perbene."

#: scenario3:scenario3_D45A122A_CE3C_4BB3_8488_C7FFF59FC7A7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ff8daafcb6c7c39f5e8bfee60216ed1f808941f6ef0941fe423042af8ed6f7e6
#. default-sha256: 625de48e386412f4e5a43eba42edacc9893ab945119f2a0c534a5d1ccea6f056
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D45A122A_CE3C_4BB3_8488_C7FFF59FC7A7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫How long have you been there?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Da quanto tempo sei lì?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_1D8BB6EE_B72B_4AE3_8BD5_1B75B210273B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cc1a141b13249285ce0582e6672984d244ea533a1c297ff523012e5bf57b6a34
#. default-sha256: adc1830bf77741e2569c8608ff5cf5177905d85619cd956ec4493f852e3d88c8
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_1D8BB6EE_B72B_4AE3_8BD5_1B75B210273B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Not long. But man, I can’t help laughin’.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫You were ⟪k:6⟫"
"completely⟪k:7⟫ in your own world there."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Non da molto.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Ma amico, non riesco a fare a meno di ridere.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫"
"Eri ⟪k:8⟫completamente⟪k:9⟫ immerso nel tuo mondo."

#: scenario3:scenario3_13D5D87F_9F1C_4BB0_8B1B_96D89F0B7219
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 42d5ba075d8ee85d8d66993ee8eb0361eb1cb475eb31f437a55a4d74abc6c239
#. default-sha256: d49492fc07d7e390d9ab564dbe4f9272ec36902113df021d37fef56a10f6a717
